  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ramadan Food Aid in Palestine, Lebanon and Jordan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For the families we serve, food parcels and vouchers mean they can celebrate the month of Ramadan with nutritious iftar and suhoor meals to break and start their fast for the day. But food prices across the region continue to rise along with unemployment and inflation - meaning even more families will be left feeling anxious about how to put food on the table rather than celebrating this year. Your support will help families across Palestine, Lebanon and Jordan celebrate comfortably.</narrative>
  </description>
